+ * cellGcm_label_wait_seq, so a host-side label wait can sleep instead of polling. `seq` = a value read earlier
+ * through cellGcm_label_seq() (read it before checking the label); returns when the sequence differs from it or
+ * after `timeout_ms` (a label written by any other path is then seen at the caller's next check). */
